{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knightica is a turn-based roguelike auto-battler where you lead an army of powerful units. Recruit, place and command your troops to free the Kingdoms. Discover amazing synergies, gather demonic souls, face dangerous monsters and lead your army to victory! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASSEMBLE YOUR ARMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enroll units of all shapes and sizes! It's up to you to make them work together! Place and rotate them to use their specific <strong>talents</strong> to the fullest. Will you lead an army of undead or put your trust in the magician's guild?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093400/extras/c5157b18601bc90f37157ca118a51dfc.poster.avif?t=1763023631\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093400/extras/c5157b18601bc90f37157ca118a51dfc.webm?t=1763023631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093400/extras/c5157b18601bc90f37157ca118a51dfc.mp4?t=1763023631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR CHOICES MATTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your commander, units, and items, and make decisions about the path you take. Is it worth stopping at this <strong>strange shop</strong>, or do you feel ready to fight an <strong>elite demon</strong>? Every run presents new opportunities to experiment with <strong>powerful combinations</strong>, ensuring no two adventures are ever the same. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093400/extras/9b6655718d9fd925872fc96da0a90714.poster.avif?t=1763023631\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093400/extras/9b6655718d9fd925872fc96da0a90714.webm?t=1763023631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093400/extras/9b6655718d9fd925872fc96da0a90714.mp4?t=1763023631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND YOUR OWN STRATEGY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong> your troops, swarm your enemies, search for the perfect ally or focus on your economy. It\u2019s up to you to find the best way to use the <strong>enchants</strong>, troops and demonic souls at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093400/extras/ddc900e99a031b14aeb7f04ce2d72309.poster.avif?t=1763023631\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093400/extras/ddc900e99a031b14aeb7f04ce2d72309.webm?t=1763023631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093400/extras/ddc900e99a031b14aeb7f04ce2d72309.mp4?t=1763023631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONQUER THE KINGDOM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your army through <strong>increasingly difficult</strong> worlds, adapt, and overcome many situations with varied enemies and <strong>terrifying bosses</strong> using unique demonic tactics. Try to go as far as you can because only you can secure the future of the realm and ensure peace prevails once more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093400/extras/0247dae8fd9a7e7341dd71dc9ed2602b.poster.avif?t=1763023631\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093400/extras/0247dae8fd9a7e7341dd71dc9ed2602b.webm?t=1763023631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093400/extras/0247dae8fd9a7e7341dd71dc9ed2602b.mp4?t=1763023631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Savior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3093400/0c733cfaeca5e4dac0d4208e7e95a9c943ed356d.jpg"},{"name":"Bane of the Demons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3093400/f64dda5a84f9521d1f85de6d926674a10a2faff7.jpg"},{"name":"Challenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3093400/017a895b950d72b8f04956855faae3cf0d1660d2.jpg"},{"name":"Protector of the Kingdoms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3093400/d93b625fcf8fda4504ece5a61693630099d74897.jpg"},{"name":"The Fellowship of the Kingdoms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3093400/dbedc1395c98d2073bd76cbaa52d5fab983c3b0e.jpg"},{"name":"The bigger they are...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3093400/68f06b99b851613b1d61b7926bba0a36a333d69f.jpg"},{"name":"Incremental","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3093400/20b31bd70763d401561766512f60b604824027c9.jpg"},{"name":"IT'S OVER 1000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3093400/d471e754a7cbe94c3b9e1a9b52ed8d509bf4b309.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3093400/3c86adbe